Statement III is true. Since ${T}_{P}$ coincides with the universal set, the statement $∀z\\in Q,\\,P(z)$ is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186381749 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152083 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "320c4694-1904-5fc7-a324-a4c89f0e3257" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements Involving Existential Quantifiers"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "99e8deea-e8f4-5ff7-bd37-2da11ae10889" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471263} {:answer/id #uuid "7cba0954-6700-5c1a-b3a9-0533c67f4a41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471264}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7cba0954-6700-5c1a-b3a9-0533c67f4a41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471264} :answer-field/id #uuid "905855c6-d163-536a-ad9f-e392902c0e00" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472137} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "802fa2ed-3e2a-5dc8-9bd4-3cc9b95510ee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471265} {:answer/id #uuid "5759a99b-eb18-5f4b-8146-b27b89d56c05" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471266}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "802fa2ed-3e2a-5dc8-9bd4-3cc9b95510ee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471265} :answer-field/id #uuid "9c260fb3-24b1-5e74-8cf9-41a7e45f67e4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident