nt II is false. Indeed, ${T}_{P}\\ne N.$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since ${T}_{P}$ is empty, the statement $∃z\\in N,\\,P(z)$ is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186381763 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152083 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "320c4694-1904-5fc7-a324-a4c89f0e3257" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements Involving Existential Quantifiers"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cad0ba93-8091-533c-a25a-a5d7cfbae973" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471269} {:answer/id #uuid "58928286-7dc1-5197-b088-818d869c772e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471270}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cad0ba93-8091-533c-a25a-a5d7cfbae973" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471269} :answer-field/id #uuid "c7842b45-92cd-5a9d-80f0-68486f8068bc" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472140} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1208e82-0729-505c-90d5-2ea36adad969" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471271} {:answer/id #uuid "856332bc-5b98-5598-b36e-d06b239ce7d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471272}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "856332bc-5b98-5598-b36e-d06b239ce7d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471272} :answer-field/id #uuid "fdb1233e-b724-550d-9b84-7a512bda69ea" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175921864